    "detail": {
      "id": 1350243,
      "name": "[Starlight - Billy] Heated Cacophony",
      "desc": "After using <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Duel King</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Starlight Retribution</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Follow-up Cannon</color>. This effect can be triggered once every 8s and <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Follow-up Cannon</color>'s DMG Multiplier is 1,200%. When successfully performing a Block during <color=#FFFFFF>Special Attack: Drive Suppression</color>, the next <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Duel King</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack: Starlight Retribution</color>, or <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Follow-up Cannon</color> can trigger an additional <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Follow-up Cannon</color>. When <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Duel King</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Follow-up Cannon</color> hits an enemy, <color=#2BAD00>DMG dealt against the target increases by 12%</color>, stacking up to 2 times, only one stack can be applied per enemy per use of a skill, lasting 20s, and repeated triggers reset the duration.",
